{{!< default}}
{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Maps of the tradition | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="For every classic disputed question, the positions the tradition took, who holds each by tradition and century, and the lines between them." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
.tfr-tool{--bg:var(--color-bg,#F0F0ED);--fg:var(--color-dark,#1C1C1A);--muted:var(--color-muted,#5A5A56);--border:var(--color-rule,#D8D8D3);--card-bg:var(--color-card,#FFFFFF);--highlight:var(--color-highlight,#E7E7E2);--accent:var(--color-accent,#8A3B2E);--grid:var(--color-rule,#E2E2DD);--font-display:var(--font-display,"EB Garamond",Georgia,serif);--font-body:var(--font-body,"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif);--sans:var(--font-body,"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif)}
/* MAPS OF THE TRADITION (2026-10-21, owner: "conceptual diagrams, visualizations between the whole tradition"). v1/maps
   (runs/minimax_1019/maps/qmap.py): for each classic question the positions, who holds each (by tradition, placed in time), the
   relations between them, the axes and the turning points. The diagram is drawn here from the JSON; the lists below it carry the
   same on a phone and for a screen reader.
   ORGANIZED (2026-10-21, owner: "text like this as one block is a slop … organize apply design principles"): a position is its name and
   count, its thesis, what it turns on (a labelled note), then its holders by tradition, each tradition under the shelf colour the
   diagram uses, each holder one row (name and dates, his claim, the page at the right), six rows shown and the rest a click away.
   The disputed questions page uses the same row. One type scale: secondary .8rem, body 1rem, headings 1.25 / 1.6 / 2rem. */
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,summary,input):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:74rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.2rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.2 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .lede{max-width:70ch;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.4rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ct{color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;left:-9999px}
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(15rem,19rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.8rem;align-items:start}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:sticky;top:.8rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 1.6rem);overflow:auto}
.tfr-tool .find{width:100%;padding:.5rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem var(--font-body);margin:0 0 .6rem}
.tfr-tool .find::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .loci{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .loci details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .loci summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.55rem .2rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}
.tfr-tool .loci summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .loci summary small{color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .loci ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .6rem;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .loci li button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:.4rem .3rem .4rem .8rem;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;border-radius:4px;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .loci li button:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .loci li button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .loci li button small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .loci li button[aria-current="true"] small{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .m h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .3rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 .9rem}
.tfr-tool .shape{max-width:72ch;margin:0 0 .8rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:.3rem 1.1rem;margin:0 0 1rem;max-width:76ch}
.tfr-tool .lab>div{display:contents}
.tfr-tool .lab dt{color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.95 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .lab ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .lab ol li+li{margin-top:.15rem}
.tfr-tool .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.35rem .4rem;margin:0 0 .9rem}
.tfr-tool .chips button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);padding:.25rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .chips button[aria-pressed="false"]{opacity:.45}
.tfr-tool .chips button i{width:.6rem;height:.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,#999);display:inline-block}
.tfr-tool .chips button.k i{width:1.1rem;height:0;border-top:2px solid var(--c,#999);border-radius:0}
.tfr-tool .chips button.k.dash i{border-top-style:dashed}
.tfr-tool .chips button.k.dot i{border-top-style:dotted}
.tfr-tool .diagram{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card-bg);padding:.8rem .8rem 1rem;margin:0 0 1.6rem}
.tfr-tool .dscroll{overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}
.tfr-tool .heads{display:grid;gap:.6rem;padding-left:56px;margin:0 0 .4rem}
.tfr-tool .heads div{font:500 1rem/1.25 var(--font-display);text-wrap:balance;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);padding:0 .2rem .35rem}
.tfr-tool .heads div small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans);margin-top:.15rem}
.tfr-tool svg.map{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}
.tfr-tool svg.map text{font:11px var(--sans);fill:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool svg.map .band{fill:var(--highlight);opacity:.45}
.tfr-tool svg.map .grid{stroke:var(--grid);stroke-width:1}
.tfr-tool svg.map .col{stroke:var(--grid);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:2 4}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge{fill:none;stroke-width:1.1;opacity:.55}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.refutes{stroke:var(--accent)}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.develops,.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.follows{stroke:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.distinguishes{stroke:var(--muted);stroke-dasharray:4 3}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.reconciles{stroke:var(--muted);stroke-dasharray:1.5 3}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.recorded{stroke-width:.8;opacity:.3}
.tfr-tool svg.map .edge.off,.tfr-tool svg.map .dot.off{display:none}
.tfr-tool svg.map .dot{cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool svg.map .dot circle{stroke:var(--card-bg);stroke-width:1.2}
.tfr-tool svg.map .dot:hover circle,.tfr-tool svg.map .dot:focus circle,.tfr-tool svg.map .dot.is-on circle{stroke:var(--fg);stroke-width:2;r:7}
.tfr-tool svg.map .dot:focus{outline:none}
.tfr-tool svg.map .dot.dim{opacity:.18}
.tfr-tool .tip{position:absolute;z-index:3;max-width:22rem;padding:.6rem .75rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;pointer-events:auto}
.tfr-tool .tip b{font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .tip .tt{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .tip p{margin:.3rem 0 0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .tip button{position:absolute;top:.2rem;right:.3rem;border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);font:1rem/1 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .sec{margin:2.2rem 0 0}
.tfr-tool .sec>h3{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .5rem;padding-bottom:.35rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .sec>h3 .ct{margin-left:.45rem}
.tfr-tool .thesis{max-width:68ch;margin:0 0 .7rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .tg{margin:1rem 0 0}
.tfr-tool .tg>h4{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;margin:0;padding:0 0 .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .sw{flex:none;width:.6rem;height:.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,#7A7A76)}
.tfr-tool .hl{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .hr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(7.5rem,12rem) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(3.2rem,auto);gap:.1rem 1.2rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.55rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .hr[hidden]{display:none}
.tfr-tool .h-who{font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .h-who small{display:block;margin-top:.1rem;color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.35 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .h-line{max-width:68ch;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .h-src{display:block;margin-top:.15rem;color:var(--muted);font:italic .8rem/1.4 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .h-pg{text-align:right;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .h-pg .pp{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .more{margin:.45rem 0 0;padding:.3rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .more:hover{border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .rk{margin:1rem 0 0}
.tfr-tool .rk>h4{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin:0;padding:0 0 .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .lk{flex:none;width:1.1rem;height:0;border-top:2px solid var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .lk.refutes{border-top-color:var(--accent)}
.tfr-tool .lk.distinguishes{border-top-style:dashed}
.tfr-tool .lk.reconciles{border-top-style:dotted}
.tfr-tool .rr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 1rem minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:.1rem .8rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.55rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .rr[hidden]{display:none}
.tfr-tool .rr .r-e{font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .rr .r-e small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.35 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .rr .r-e i{font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .rr .r-to{color:var(--muted);text-align:center}
.tfr-tool .rr .r-note{color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .tps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .tps>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:7.5rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:.1rem 1.2rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .tp-c{font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .tps p{margin:0;max-width:68ch;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .tps p.tp-who{margin-top:.25rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .tp-who .pg{white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pg{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .next{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin:2rem 0 0;padding-top:.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .next button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;cursor:pointer;padding:.2rem 0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-align:left}
.tfr-tool .next span+button,.tfr-tool .next button+button{text-align:right}
.tfr-tool .note{max-width:72ch;margin:2rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .muted{color:var(--muted)}
@media (max-width:860px){.tfr-tool .cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:static;max-height:none;overflow:visible}
.tfr-tool .loci{max-height:min(50vh,22rem);overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}}
@media (max-width:640px){.tfr-tool .wrap{padding:1.2rem 1rem 3rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font-size:1.6rem}
.tfr-tool .m h2{font-size:1.25rem}
.tfr-tool .lab{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin-bottom:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .diagram{padding:.6rem .6rem .8rem}
.tfr-tool .dscroll>div{min-width:max(100%,calc(var(--np,4) * 8rem + 56px))}
.tfr-tool svg.map text{font-size:13px}
.tfr-tool .hr{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"who pg" "line line";column-gap:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .h-who{grid-area:who}
.tfr-tool .h-pg{grid-area:pg}
.tfr-tool .h-line{grid-area:line;margin-top:.2rem}
.tfr-tool .rr{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 1rem minmax(0,1fr)}
.tfr-tool .rr .r-note{grid-column:1/-1;margin-top:.2rem}
.tfr-tool .tps>li{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.tfr-tool .next{flex-direction:column}
.tfr-tool .next span+button,.tfr-tool .next button+button{text-align:left}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.tfr-tool svg.map .dot circle{transition:r .12s ease-out}}
</style>
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /the-faith-received/maps/: Maps of the tradition, as The Faith Received has them (tools/prdl_reader_prototype/maps.html, 2026-10-21): for each
     classic question the positions the tradition took, every author placed by century and tradition under his position, the lines between
     them, the axes and the turning points (v1/maps on the library worker). The hero is the theme's; the body and faith-maps.js the library's. --}}
<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
    <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> Maps of the tradition</p>
    <h1 class="bhero-title">Maps of the tradition</h1>
    <p class="bhero-lede">For each classic disputed question: the positions the tradition took, named in its own terms; who holds each, placed by tradition and century; the lines between them, where one answers, develops or distinguishes another; the axes the disagreement runs along, and its turning points. Every author stands on his pages.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/faith-tfr-rail.js"}}" defer></script>
<main class="tfr-tool"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="lede" hidden>For each classic disputed question: the positions the tradition took, named in its own terms; who holds each, placed by tradition and century; the lines between them, where one answers, develops or distinguishes another; the axes the disagreement runs along, and its turning points. Every author stands on his pages.</p>
  <div class="cols">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="The questions">
      <input class="find" id="find" type="search" placeholder="Find a question" aria-label="Find a question" autocomplete="off">
      <ol class="loci" id="loci"><li class="muted">Loading…</li></ol>
    </nav>
    <article class="m" id="m" aria-live="polite"></article>
  </div>
  <p class="note" id="note"></p>
</div></main>
<script src="{{asset "js/faith-maps.js"}}&amp;frv=82f109de8630161c"></script>
